        "confidence": 0.93
      },
      {
        "text": "The speaker has credibility and legitimacy to question political decisions due to their self-assessment of being 'great'.",
        "confidence": 0.91
      },
      {
        "text": "The relocation of undocumented immigrants to Martha's Vineyard was a coordinated policy action by authorities.",
        "confidence": 0.89
      },
      {
        "text": "A public figure should respond directly to pointed questions about politically sensitive topics.",
        "confidence": 0.88
      },
      {
        "text": "The claim that migrants didn't know their destination is widely circulated but false.",
        "confidence": 0.87
      },
      {
        "text": "The audience expects accountability on controversial immigration policies.",
