    "turn_text": "Now, okay, we've gotten that out of the way. I actually really want to focus on Florida because we're not even into the midterms yet. And so many people want to talk about 2024. I'd actually, I'm curious about your reelection and Florida. My dad is a first generation American board and raised in Coral Gables. I took him to his high school reunion, 50th high school reunion a couple of years ago. And he wanted to go show me where they used to go on mission trips down to this Indian reservation. It was now an Aston Martin dealership. The whole place is exploded down there. He couldn't believe it. The economic growth in Florida has been astonishing, particularly during COVID compared to other states. What does a second term Ron DeSantis administration look like for Florida?",
