    "turn_text": "Governor, last question for you. You got an open mic here and I know a lot of people in Georgia are listening on my flagship station. How would you explain to Republicans who continually punt on the issue of giving kids access to better school choice opportunities? How would you explain to them that looking at Florida, this school reform is probably a good idea for other Republicans to embrace?",
